                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f \cdot (-) :  A \to A
            that multiplies by
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
