          %p
            This description should be compared with the analogous description of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+groupoid"} action groupoid
            by a weak colimit. One sees that the groupoid algebra is a linear incarnation of the action groupoid in some sense.
          %h3#InTermsOfCompositionOfSpans In terms of composition of spans
