          %h4#ReferencesModulesOverConvolutionAlgebra Modules over Lie groupoid convolution algebras and K-theory
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modules"} modules
            over Lie groupoid convolution algebras is in the following articles.
          %p
