            %a{:href => "#Bos"}> Bos, chapter 7
            ) is discussion refining this to continuous representations and representation of a convolution
            = succeed "-algebra," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mo *
