            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%A9tale+groupoids"} étale groupoids
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jure+Kali%C5%A1nik"}> Jure Kališnik
              ,
              %em Groupoid representations and modules over the convolution algebras
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0806.1832"}> arXiv:0806.1832
              )
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/operator+K-theory"} operator K-theory
            of groupoid convolution algebras (the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
